Initial commit: offline captcha reader

Command line wrapper around ddddocr for reading image captchas locally, used
by the UMPay web and Android suites. Nothing leaves the machine.

The vendored ddddocr library and its ONNX models are not committed - they
come to 86MB, and one model alone is past the size GitHub starts warning
about. Install it with: pip install ddddocr

